# Sun Sports — presentation and widgets

## Structure

- Prefer smaller widgets over deep trees; use **`const`** constructors when dependencies allow
- Platform splits: reuse **`ResponsiveBuilder`** rather than ad-hoc width checks unless the file already documents a specific constraint (e.g. `MediaQuery` + `Breakpoints.mobile`)

## Theming and assets

- Colors/typography: **`AppColorStyles`**, **`AppTextStyles`**, spacing/radius in **`core/utils/styles/`**
- Images/icons: existing helpers (**`ImageHelper`**, **`AppImages`**, Rive/Lottie where already used)—match surrounding imports

## Performance gotchas

- Avoid **`SliverFillRemaining` + `LayoutBuilder`** patterns that trigger intrinsic height issues; follow existing comments in sport mobile screens when adding slivers
- Lists/grids: prefer patterns already used in the feature (shimmer, pagination notifiers from `core/pagination/`)

## Networking and live data

- Sport odds and bet slip state: respect **websocket**-driven providers; do not bypass **`WebSocketManager`** / subscription patterns when updating bet cards or event lists
